  <name>Total Solar Eclipse of 2026 Aug 12 - full path</name>
  <description>Total Solar Eclipse of 2026 Aug 12. Path data: NASA/GSFC (Fred Espenak), https://eclipse.gsfc.nasa.gov/SEpath/SEpath2001/SE2026Aug12Tpath.html. WGS 84, sampled at 120-second intervals. The path crosses the north pole, which Web Mercator cannot draw sensibly - use the regional overlay for chase planning.</description>
